course: dictionary
lesson: 472
title: Arrival and arrivals
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Arrival comes from the verb arrive, which means to reach a place. The context around the word tells you what it means. «A triage nurse checks everyone on arrival, and the sickest go first.» On arrival means when you reach the hospital, so the nurse checks you as soon as you get there.
explain: An arrival can also be a person or thing that has just come. «Our new arrival is a baby brother» means the baby has just come into the family. A new pupil who has just joined a school is also a new arrival.
explain: Arrivals can mean the part of an airport where people come in after landing. Look for the sign that says «Arrivals» and you will know where to wait for someone who has flown in. Use the clues around the word, then check by swapping in your meaning.
fact: Arrival is the act of reaching a place, or coming to where you were going.
fact: An arrival is a person or thing that has just come, such as a new baby or a new pupil.
fact: Arrivals is the part of an airport where people come in after landing.
fact: «On arrival» means when you get there, and «time of arrival» means the time something reaches its place.
fact: On a timetable, a time with «+1» after it means the arrival is on the next day.
exercise: «A triage nurse checks everyone on arrival.» What does on arrival mean? | When you are asleep | *When you reach the hospital | Before you are born | When you leave the hospital
exercise: «A train leaves at 14h05 and arrives at 16h50.» What is the arrival time? | 2 hours 45 minutes | 16h05 | *16h50 | 14h05
exercise: «Départ means departure and arrivée means arrival.» Which French word means arrival? | *Arrivée | Départ | Avion | Train
test: Mum says, «Our new arrival is a baby brother.» What is the new arrival? | A holiday | *A baby who has just come | A house | A way to travel
test: Where do people go when they land at an airport and come in? | The car park | *Arrivals | Departures | The runway
exam: A bus leaves at 9h10 and takes 30 minutes. What is its time of arrival? | *9h40 | 30 minutes | 9h10 | 9h30
